.TH WMTUBE 1 "October 2026" "wmtube 0.1" "Window Maker dockapps"
.SH NAME
wmtube \- play YouTube and PeerTube videos inside a Window Maker dockapp
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B wmtube
[\fIoptions\fR] [\fIURL\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B wmtube
is a 64x64 dockapp that streams a YouTube, PeerTube (any instance) or other
yt-dlp supported video
inside its tile. The 16:9 video fills a 56x32 band; the rows above and below
can show a scrolling title and the elapsed / total play time in the classic
LED dockapp style.
.PP
Playback is done by libmpv, which uses
.BR yt-dlp (1)
to resolve the URL. A low-resolution stream is requested by default to keep
CPU and bandwidth use small.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-display " display"
X display to connect to.
.TP
.BI \-mode " both|title|time|none"
Which text rows to show initially (default \fBboth\fR).
.TP
.BI \-fg " color"
Text colour (default #20B2AE).
.TP
.BI \-bg " color"
Background colour (default #202020).
.TP
.B \-mute
Start muted.
.TP
.B \-loop
Loop the video forever.
.TP
.BI \-ytdl\-format " format"
yt-dlp format selector (default prefers 144p H.264 plus best audio).
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-help
Show a short help text.
.SH MOUSE
.TP
.B Left click
Pause / resume (restarts the video once it has ended). When no video is
loaded, toggles the scrolling help text instead (and clears any error
message), so an idle docked tile can sit still.
.TP
.B Double click
Open the video full size in a separate \fBmpv\fR at the current position and
pause the dockapp.
.TP
.B Middle click
Play the URL currently in the PRIMARY selection (or, failing that, the
CLIPBOARD). Only http:// and https:// URLs (or a bare youtube.com / youtu.be
address) are accepted from the selection, so PeerTube links need their full
https:// URL; local files and other mpv
protocols must be given on the command line.
.TP
.B Right click
Cycle the text rows: both, title only, time only, none.
.TP
.B Shift + left click / Shift + right click
Seek back / forward 10 seconds.
.TP
.B Scroll wheel
Volume up / down; the level is shown briefly in the time row.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mpv (1),
.BR yt-dlp (1),
.BR wmaker (1)
